        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Crayation: The First Sketch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Survival Platformer Horror Experience</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the abandoned <strong>Crayation Plaza</strong> as <strong>Melissa Chen</strong>, a podcaster investigating the mysterious shutdown of the beloved children’s attraction. What starts as a simple exploration spirals into a fight for survival when the colorful crayon mascots come to life… and they aren’t so friendly anymore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Night:</strong> Last until <strong>6 AM</strong> while each hour introduces a new mascot with its own unique behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stacking Threats:</strong> Every mascot remains active after its debut, forcing you to manage multiple mechanics at once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platformer Survival Horror:</strong> Navigate multi-level rooms, jump broken catwalks, crawl into vents, and use environmental tools to evade danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense Mechanic:</strong> Activate buttons at the right moment to temporarily banish mascots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Search for <strong>hidden notes</strong> and <strong>audio tapes</strong> to uncover Crayation Plaza’s dark history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Value:</strong> Randomized mascot spawn timings, key placements, and hidden lore encourage multiple playthroughs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mascots</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Rudy</strong> → Freeze when you see him… or die when you don’t.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue Bella</strong> → Giggles mean danger; hide within 5 seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yellow Yanni</strong> → Once spotted, prepare for relentless chase sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green Gary</strong> → Master the lights, or risk being hunted in total darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Violet Vicky</strong> → Her violin screeches demand absolute stillness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mark-0</strong> <i>(secret antagonist)</i> → Corrupts the mascots, breaking their rules entirely.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the <strong>Sketcher’s Incident</strong> through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handwritten employee notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therapy session transcripts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distorted audio logs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCTV archives revealing Mark-0’s horrifying purpose</p></li></ul>",
